    {
      "name": "Skeleton Hierarchy Tree",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "hierarchy-tree",
      "description": "A self-contained hierarchy preview. The application uses a native WPF TreeView; its platform active/inactive selection brushes and expanders remain authoritative.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tree\" aria-label=\"骨骼层级树\"><h3>骨骼层级</h3><details open><summary>Hips</summary><details><summary><span class=\"ds-tree-selected\" tabindex=\"0\">LeftHip</span></summary><span>LeftKnee</span></details><details><summary>RightHip</summary><span>RightKnee</span></details><details><summary>Chest</summary><span>Neck</span></details></details><p>3 通道：Z旋转 → X旋转 → Y旋转</p></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tree{width:240px;color:#172438;font:12px \"Microsoft YaHei UI\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-tree h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}.ds-tree details details{margin-left:16px}.ds-tree summary{cursor:pointer}.ds-tree summary:focus-visible{outline:1px dotted currentColor}.ds-tree-selected:focus-visible{background:Highlight;color:HighlightText;outline:none}.ds-tree p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#526278;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
